---

DataChannelXT statically links the following third-party libraries into its
committed per-platform binaries:

  - libdatachannel  (MPL-2.0)
  - libjuice        (MPL-2.0)  - libdatachannel's vendored ICE agent
  - usrsctp         (BSD-3-Clause) - its vendored SCTP stack
  - plog            (MIT) - its vendored logging library

DTLS comes from the system OpenSSL, which is not bundled. The full license
texts are reproduced in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md alongside this file, as those
licenses require for binary distribution.
